{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "2261aae2-88cd-471a-a41f-7d82acf7e3d1",
  "Description": "Detects objects in a live camera image with an efficientdet-lite model and shows the built-in debug view: the camera frame with a box, label and score per object.\n\nTurn [Debug] off to get the clean camera image on [OutputTexture]. The detections are provided as data: [PointBuffer] holds 5 points per object (the center plus the 4 box corners) in image space (X from -aspect to aspect, Y from -1 to 1), with F1 carrying the detection confidence. [ObjectCount] holds the number of objects, [ObjectData] is a dictionary of label -> best confidence, and [ActiveCategories] lists the detected labels.\n\n[CategoryAllowlist] / [CategoryDenylist] filter the 80 COCO classes the model knows (person, cup, laptop, couch, ...).",
  "InputUis": [],
