      "Id": "fe7dd66f-7e4d-45c3-9d33-e3cf0e466309",
      "Title": "This example needs a camera\n\n1. Select the [VideoDeviceInput] op\n2. Pick your camera in the InputDeviceName field\n3. Tick [Active] - put yourself (or a hand / objects) in view\n\nThe output shows the operator's debug view with the detected landmarks. Turn its [Debug] input off to get the clean camera image, and open the operator's outputs (PointBuffer, counts, ...) to drive your own visuals.",
